Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.69,0:07:47.45,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\fnHYQiHei 95S\fs25\c&HC5BC5B&\frz314\fax-0.5795\pos(1739,165)}带我走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:50.44,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,900)\fs85\c&H5A21A3&\shad4.5\4c&HFFFFFF&}天堂大战 第三集 婊之复仇
